        "reply_count": 5,
        "retweet_count": 12
      },
      "text": "In 2020, I got to meet and learn from many incredible people.\n\nWhat I’ve noticed separates those who are truly great and change the world vs other very successful people is NOT intelligence or hustle.\n\nIt is the authenticity and genuineness of their intrinsic ambition.\n\nOnward!",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1344745514051448836"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "615818451",
      "created_at": "2020-12-29T21:55:18.000Z",
