      },
      "text": ".@ouraring vs Apple Watch is a case study in focus\n\nOura focused on multi-day charge sleep/activity tracking. To me, it’s much better than the ⌚️\n\nThe ⌚️ does “more”, but worse for the core use case. Apple could have built a ring, but instead conformed to existing big markets(⌚️)",
