          "id": "1342637873296633856",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "Thank you to everyone who has helped create @scale_AI: our team, our customers, our investors, and our guardian angels.\n\nIn the words of Steve Jobs, the journey is the reward. I wouldn’t have traded our journey for anything.\n\nHappy holidays!",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1342637874470998016"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "615818451",
      "created_at": "2020-12-26T01:06:28.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "1342637873296633856"
