        "like_count": 123,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 3,
        "retweet_count": 3
      },
      "text": "In true holiday spirit:\n\nLooking back on the past 4 years of building @scale_AI, it’s been filled with moments of great accomplishment and stretches hard work in uncertain times.\n\nI am deeply thankful for our charmed path—it’s hard to describe it as anything less than pure magic.",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1342637873296633856"
    },
    {
