      },
      "text": ".@DoorDash is an incredible company. Our SF office is right below theirs, and I’m thankful we have them to look up to (in many ways).\n\nIn a memo to Scale earlier this year, I praised DoorDash on their strategy and focus.\n\nCongrats to @t_xu @stanleytang @andyfang &amp; team! https://t.co/m0uKwbqUQY",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1337840723631067136"
