        "quote_count": 8,
        "reply_count": 18,
        "retweet_count": 12
      },
      "text": "SF Bay Area will still be a magnet for a meaningful proportion of the most talented and ambitious people in the world.\n\nSome people will leave. But amazing people will take their place.\n\nThe short-term of SF might look weak, but the long-term is still very strong.",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1335687834234048512"
