      ],
      "text": "8/ The ultimate hack is to not rely on compressions at all.\n\nBe an engineer, salesperson, support rep, ops person. Develop uncompressed understandings of how everything works together, and use that to build the right thing.\n\nThat has been the key to every great product I know of. https://t.co/tjsx2oqhby",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1335355219761188866"
    },
    {
