          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "5/ The version of this that nearly every coder has felt:\n\nSomeone asks you to do something, it's not *that* easy to build, and it also doesn't *really* solve the customer's problem. Double whammy of inefficiency. https://t.co/XeduGlXVXz",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1335355211905265664"
