          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "4/ Put another way, nobody is telling the full truth. Mostly by omission, and mostly unintentionally.\n\nThis is *especially* true of customers, who, like the rest of us, are not very good information compressors. https://t.co/brl5L4FCj9",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1335355208059084800"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "615818451",
      "created_at": "2020-12-05T22:47:44.000Z",
